UgyBAUJb3uBnYo3Z48J4AaABAg,,False,@RavenSutcliffe,"I'm not usually into k-pop as like, a genre. The odd song here and there, but I can't truly consider myself a stan of any group (this is not a dig, just sorta how things played out).

I went to the official audio of this song and half of the comments were about this, so I thought I'd check it out. I love dance, why not.

Jaw. On. The. Floor. From the clothes to the atmosphere/visuals, the Michael Jackson influences, the male ballet influences too, the clear style, the sheer difficulty and how he makes it look effortless. And he choreographed this himself, he CLEARLY knows his stuff. Absolutely top notch. Doesn't hurt that he's gorgeous, too.

Hats off, I literally had no idea who he was before today beyond some people mentioning his group and this feels like a revelation. Standing ovation, no doubt. I certainly see why everyone was talking about it!",8,2025-04-11T13:57:07Z,2025-04-11T13:57:07Z
