UgwNwpe9ylp9TcJtxWx4AaABAg,,False,@SheisRalu25,"I'm in love with this human being. He's capable of making people (stays and not stays) so emotional with his dance moves, his voice and lyricism, and his angelic face. It's so strange being in love with someone you never met, but it's not about obsession. It's not about loving an idol. It's about being aware of how much a young human being has been through and how many people out there treated him like an enemy, for what? It's about wanting to hug him so badly and telling him he's doing great. He's handsome, he's talented but what's more important, he's kind. He's a human being who deserves to be respected and loved. He deserves to be hugged and told ""You are okay. You are doing great. You are loved. Everybody loves you, your family and friends love you, and I do love you."" I hope he will experience that kind of love which will make him understand how precious he is. I hope someone, one day, will be able to give him what he truly deserves. I want him to be happy, I want him to be at peace with himself ❤️ Hyunjin, you deserve the universe.",8,2024-12-28T17:54:00Z,2024-12-28T17:54:00Z
