어떻게 지내세요?

I just lost my bus ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ I was waiting like 40 minutes and I was drawing.. and my bus passed and didn't stop ㅋㅋㅋㅋ
So I took a car now, I guess would be dangerous to wait another 40 minutes..

Anyway
I was thinking about you while drawing, I guess I'm drawing better than before. I really like to draw people in random scenes I imagine. It's nice to draw something you dreamed about or you only have in your mind. 

My recess finished so I'm back to work at night.. the good news is that I'll probably come more often. I like to write while I'm in the car or the bus. It's at night and I'm alone, so it's like telling my day before sleeping.  I really like when you do it... so I'll keep doing the same. 

Thanks for sharing and texting. I always miss hearing from you. Not really because I need to know what you're doing, but it's comforting to have a conversation about daily things. It's nice to have someone who it's there to listen to you. Smells like home.

Have a nice day,
Working or enjoying or both

Love you always


Joy",2,2022-08-09T00:39:57Z,2022-08-09T00:39:57Z
