UgwyvwsunlgjSiMaw3p4AaABAg,,False,@by_joy,"Hello my tomorrow
Did you sleep well??

I guess you're probably feeling better since you're coming more often.. but I still miss you a lot these days.

Baby, I was happy to see you on vlive.  I miss seeing you and even more hearing you talking. It's not a demand. Please, always think about these words as part of a very beautiful feeling. I am grateful for all of it.

The day you 8 came on the live, I was terrible, I told you that I would have worse days because I have to face some things, remember?  Well, I faced something and so I was completely out of strength.  And somehow, you guys showed up, wow, I literally felt protected.

I always wanted here to be a safe place for you and I've focused so much on it over the years that I never recognized how much I count on you too, on all of you. I think I never wanted to put on something like a burden on you. However over time it was something that naturally happened.

I want to cry now saying all of these, but it's a good cry.  I always thought I got to meet you at a time you needed most but... like everything I feel here... I think I needed you as well.  Whatever this line that surrounds me is, it goes to you but it also comes to me.



I love you, always and immensely.




Joy


Ps. Many small things also happened, my parents came to spend a week with me on vacation.
Ps2. I also took a few days off.
Ps3. I took my parents for walks to nice places around here and they were very happy.
Ps4. I managed to ride a bike in a park as I had wanted for a long time.
Ps5. I cleaned a room left here at home, and now I have a place to paint.
Ps6. The last show at USA was just wonderful, I cried and laughed until the end. I'm really sorry you didn't come here, and I couldn't go. Never being able to see this show in person is sad but... I'm glad you were so happy on this tour.
Ps7. Thanks again, for everything. I know you make a lot of effort, and that you charge yourself too.. I appreciate it.  Not because I think you need to, but because you are just like that. Thanks.
Ps8. Loving you doesn't require any effort.",2,2022-07-25T01:44:59Z,2022-07-25T01:44:59Z
