UgzUUhmwO51BZZtOxpR4AaABAg,,False,@by_joy,"Hey Hyune,
How are you? Are you still happy about being on the stage yesterday?
I guess yesterday will always make me think about how much you love to be on the stage with stays. I always knew but…
To be honest, it broke my heart a little to see you making an extra effort even through pain, I guess I can feel it too. I always care about it because I know you must feel a lot anyway, having to perform and your body can’t rest what it should, plus you always want to do more and better. I understand. Really. I do. (I kinda fell for it too)
That’s why it’s something I value a lot.
But, do you know I love you more than any of these? More than stages, and concerts, and performances, and songs... Hwang Hyunjin is what I care about the most. It's ok. It's not a burden. So… is it ok If I worry about you a lot? 
Because it's ok for me... it’s ok if you get hurt, or if you get sad, or if you got bitten by a mosquito.
I don’t love you because of the things you can give me, I just do. And I’m happy.
I’m happy to be by your side through all kinds of days.

Don’t hide it.
It’s ok.
To be loved and cared… it’s ok.
Trust me.


Always,
Joy.",4,2022-07-13T14:27:06Z,2022-07-13T14:27:06Z
