Ugxx_wZTQUYIJMiSJtZ4AaABAg,,False,@by_joy,"안녕 baby ~~~~ Did you have a good day? Are you anxious about tomorrow? 
We didn't have any news about but I guess the concert is up, right? I hope you can be with stays and have a lot of fun tomorrow.
I know the happiness you get from performing is something else.
But, still, is ok if I am happy for today? If am smiling? If you make me happy just by looking deep into your eyes.
I confess that it is easy for me to worry about you, (and that's not a problem, it will never be), so when I have moments like this, I feel relieved just by looking into your eyes.
I'm happy that you missed us and came again. I'm happy just by remembering the details.. the smiles you gave, the time you sang, the looks, the silences, when you feel secure or insecure. Excited or relaxed.
I'm sorry if I'm talking too much.. ㅋㅋ
Just.. know that I love you, ok?

It's always about who you are, not what you have to do or not.

Always

Joy.",3,2022-07-09T02:24:54Z,2022-07-09T02:24:54Z
