joy""


That's was the messages I sent you earlier. 
Even being just a coincidence I was happy to see you coming on vlive today.
I was glad that I could be with you a little, and you're doing something you liked.

That's the prettiest side of you, the way you do simple things, gestures, how you get excited, how sometimes you just don't wanna be alone and sometimes you do. 

