Ugyofk9vz-g-nYjXIul4AaABAg,,False,@by_joy,"안녕 baby,


어떻게 지내세요? 

We're still in the same time zone, so I'm gonna wish a good tomorrow for us both.

I'm a bit tired now, but I'm ok. 

I got the D+500 notification on Bubble. 500 days that passed slowly and quickly at the same time. In any way, by being with you, life has changed. I changed. 

It's a strong word.. I think I just started to see myself differently. It's hard to say now that I'm not special because.. the love you make me feel is so precious. I keep thinking how special someone must be to be capable of bringing a feeling like this to life. 

I had so many scars of being mistreated by people I trusted. I do trust easily too.. and I just completely stopped showing myself with time. (Like I'm doing right now.)

Somehow, you, across the planet, in a different language, not even knowing I existed, managed to do it.




Always,


Joy.",4,2022-07-06T23:04:40Z,2022-07-06T23:04:40Z
