Ugw1_zfdRjils5buMGB4AaABAg,,False,@by_joy,"Here I am agaaain,

How are you? 

I've been sending some messages on bubble, I didn't disappear ㅋㅋ I was worried and you know how we don't like to talk when we're in a bad mood?
I like to say nice things here, or just talk.

But, to be honest, I know how good it is to rely on someone, and I really hope you do, without feeling that it's a burden. 
I would really appreciate if you came and talk so.. feel free.

And I felt like you did it, on Sunday, when you came. I was so tense that day, because, I know how you were feeling and none of us can really do anything about it but
