Do nothing ㅋㅋㅋ I lay down on my bed, and listened to you, sang along sometimes... thanks. 

I hope you still can find a way to use your time doing nice things, that will make you feel better (despite the mosquitos)


Doesn't matter what
I'll be by your side



Always, more


Joy.



