And today, I am feeling better already. I went to a Monet art exhibit. I want to talk more about it later.


For today I'm going...
I love you, and I'll say that
That I love how you are. I love your goodnights, I love your calls on vlive, I love the sound of the pencil while you draw, I love the way you look to stays, I love every part of you that you express, it reaches me.. every feeling, reaches me.

Thanks for.. mostly, everything.


Always,
Joy.",1,2022-06-01T03:22:07Z,2022-06-01T03:22:07Z
