UgxX8NRUz8AUdTZqIjN4AaABAg,,False,@by_joy,"안녕 baby ❤️

I just finished exercising... I'm all sweat on the floor catching my breath again. After all this activity, you are still the first thing that came into my mind again. Funny, right?

I really hope you're still sleeping if you went to bed that late. What are you up to, huh?

The sky is a little purple now. Is it pollution? Even being late is kinda clear. I like, though, to stare at the sky. It's lonely and peaceful. I guess it is nice how a place may change completely, but the sky is always the same. Even though, every day he expresses new colors. 

Maybe the sky has some feeling of its own. ㅋㅋㅋ I know it is silly, but it's comforting. That's why sometimes I compare you with the sky. All your colors. Special feelings.

I really don't need any effort to get you, my heart is quicker than my mind. It's nice to know your feelings.. even the one I wish you didn't have. I wish I could do more than understand. 

I'll do my best to be someone that can be loved by you for a long time. As I also, and more importantly, want to love myself fully. 



Always,



Joy.",5,2022-05-08T00:00:02Z,2022-05-08T00:00:02Z
