Ugy4HUgp6s43Gq9zXWJ4AaABAg,,False,@by_joy,"안녕 baby,
잘 잤어?

Do you have many plans for today?

Did you ever feel lonely in a crowded room? I think it's a common feeling. I was with some people that have known me my whole life and, even so.. I felt so invisible. I guess I spent a lot of time away from them..

I heard that I never make real connections with people, that I keep myself distant and I'm hard to let people get close me..

The funny thing is that no one sees me as a shy, introverted person. I trained myself to be polite and greet everyone, but that's a lot for me.. like, doing more than that, it takes a lot of energy..

I can feel very insecure around people sometimes, anyway. I tried to talk to a close person and he didn't understand how I was feeling.. Is it too hard?


I'm sorry to say all those things to you like this, I just.. felt like it.

I'm better now. I gave myself some quality time today. I read a lot today. I almost finished a book! It's a good one.. the midnight library. It makes me think a lot too. I really don't like to regret things..
I wonder how heavy my regret book would be..
I can be wrong.. but I don't see myself having many regrets.

Anyway.. besides that, I watched some yt videos and drew, listened to some songs. I saved some for you.

There was this song.. Lost Stars, did you watch the movie?? Begin again? Oh, I loved this movie. The soundtrack is so great.

I'm feeling better after taking a rest like this on the holiday.

I hope you can find someone that you can feel comfortable to talk and be yourself. (Probably you already have with the members) All the thoughts you have before bed and the things you're sharing on your journal, these pieces of you..
Don't ever think they are too silly or too weird or anything like this

I used to think like this.. but here I am. Writing and talking here.

Yours,
Joy.




Ps. I totally recommend this book I mentioned.",0,2022-04-17T03:21:01Z,2022-04-17T03:30:07Z
